===Follow Misha and help him recover his memories{{subst:void|<!--103280217-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}
:Not long ago...
:'''Misha:''' What is this place...?
:'''Himeko:''' Does this place ring any bells, Misha?
:'''Misha:''' I... don't know, but I feel a sense of déjà vu. What is this place?
:'''Himeko:''' It's the realm within a dream bubble. This was left to the Astral Express by a Nameless, but weirdly when we entered it, it was completely empty.
:'''Himeko:''' Dr. Edward from the Dreamscape Sales Store told me that dreams are formed from memories, and a dream bubble can't take shape if its core is empty.
:'''Himeko:''' So I thought you might be able to help us in unraveling this mystery, Misha? As a hotel {{Rubi|doorman|bellboy}}, you know Penacony best among us.
:'''Misha:''' Hmm, I don't know much about dream bubbles, but if you want to figure out what this mansion is... I'll do my best!
:'''Himeko:''' I'm counting on you then.
:'''March 7th:''' Himeko... I still don't get it. Why were you so sure that {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Misha had a connection with this dream bubble}}?
:'''Himeko:''' I wasn't sure. It was just a hunch, but since Misha feels familiar with this place... my hunch might be correct.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} This place looks a bit familiar...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} This place feels a bit nostalgic...
:'''Himeko:''' Exactly, this is where you and Firefly encountered "Death," which we now know as "Dormancy." Considering its connection to Dreamflux Reef, it's not surprising it appeared here.
:{{tx}}
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=A Child's Dream|update|Time reverses to the point before you left Dreamflux Reef. Himeko returns from Golden Hour with a powerful deduction: There may be some inextricable link between the empty dream bubble that the Watchmaker is holding and Misha the bellboy.<br />In order to prove it, you take Misha back into Mikhail's dream bubble... If everything goes as expected, the truth may be lurking here in this long dream of the child.}}
