;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Misha:''' "The water resembles a precious jewel, embedded in the dreams of all seafarers."
:'''Misha:''' "Every time I gaze at the shimmering lights beneath the waves, it feels as though I'm back in this place, standing by your side..."
:'''Himeko:''' Have you recalled anything, Misha?
:'''Misha:''' Yeah, I saw these sentences in Grandpa's logbook. He used to say that despite the perils of the sea, whenever he stood on the deck in the afternoon, overlooking the sparkling waves, he would think of this fountain in front of his house.
:'''Misha:''' He often said that those moments felt like returning to his family's side, and the difficulties at sea didn't seem quite as challenging.
:'''March 7th:''' *sigh* You know, I quite understand such sentiments...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Don't sigh, or you'll start getting gray hair...
::'''March 7th:''' Hey, don't tease! I was just being a bit sentimental.
::You're talking like an elder.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're talking like an elder.
:'''March 7th:''' I'm not an elder. I was just being a bit sentimental.
:'''Himeko:''' Perhaps every adventurer far from home carries a fountain within their soul. Even though the other side of the sea remains shrouded in the unknown, the fountain in front of his house serves as a compass, leading him back to his cherished ones.
:{{tx}}
;(Unused &mdash; Talk)
