===Go to the other end of the room{{subst:void|<!--103280209-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}


:'''Misha:''' This is it. This... is my {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|room of clocks}}.
:'''Misha:''' While I spent my time waiting for Grandpa to return from his voyage, Walder gave me this workshop, and it became my "secret base"...
:'''Misha:''' Here, I learned how to repair clockwork and gears out of my fondness of precision mechanics. In my dreams, I was the captain of the "Compass," embarking on adventures with my companions, Clockie and Miss Mirror, in search of the New World.
:'''Misha:''' I... I was born and raised here.
:'''Himeko:''' So, this building in the dream bubble is your childhood "home."
:'''Misha:''' Yes, but not exactly. To be more precise...
:'''Misha:''' This "dream bubble" itself is my home.
:'''Himeko:''' Looks like you've remembered everything now.
:'''March 7th:''' Wait, wait! Why does it feel like everyone else knows something I don't?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Yeah, you're the only one still in the dark.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Too bad I don't know either...
:'''Himeko:''' March, do you remember when (Trailblazer) mentioned a "Clockie" that only {{MC|м=he|ж=she}} could see?
:'''March 7th:''' Yeah, the little guy here, right? But we all saw him in Dreamflux Reef, right? And Mr. Yang even greeted him.
:'''Clockie:''' Looks like everyone on the Astral Express has a childlike spirit!
:'''Himeko:''' The answer lies in the Astral Express. (Trailblazer)'s experience shows that neither Firefly nor Acheron can see this Clockie.
:'''Himeko:''' And when we were in Dreamflux Reef, you may have noticed that for some reason, nobody outside of the Crew... had ever talked with Clockie.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Yeah, I noticed that, too.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Wait, really?
:'''Himeko:''' A memetic life that can only be seen by a select few... It's just like a hidden message... left by someone for the Nameless.
:{{tx}}
:{{tx}}
:'''Himeko:''' All right, everyone. Let's make a decision.
:'''Himeko:''' Although I don't think anyone will have any objections.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'll choose the Trailblaze.
::'''March 7th:''' Of course. We've come this far. Surely there's no other option than moving forward.
::'''Himeko:''' In that case, it's unanimous.
::I want to witness the legacy.
::'''March 7th:''' Of course. We've come this far. Surely there's no other option than moving forward.
::'''Himeko:''' In that case, it's unanimous.
::I object!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I want to witness the legacy.
::'''March 7th:''' Of course. We've come this far. Surely there's no other option than moving forward.
::'''Himeko:''' In that case, it's unanimous.
::I object!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I object!
:'''March 7th:''' Come on... Stop joking at a moment like this. We've come this far. Surely there's no other option than moving forward.
:'''Himeko:''' In that case, the vote stands at two to one.
:'''Himeko:''' Then let's proceed together to the end of this dream... and tell Mikhail our decision.
:{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

